{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22754","headline":"李十一舍人松园饮小酎酒得元八侍御诗叙云在台中推院有鞫狱之苦即事书怀因酬四韵 · 白居易","name":"李十一舍人松园饮小酎酒得元八侍御诗叙云在台中推院有鞫狱之苦即事书怀因酬四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱酒舍人开小酌，能文御史寄新诗。\n乱松园里醉相忆，古柏厅前忙不知。\n早夏我当逃暑日，晚衙君是虑囚时。\n唯应清夜无公事，新草亭中好一期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22754.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22754","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}